1
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:48,000
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:51,060
[Episode 21]

3
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:11,900
Kitty.

4
00:02:12,610 --> 00:02:13,080
Kitty.

5
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,100
Come here.

6
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:17,760
Hi,

7
00:02:18,829 --> 00:02:19,620
kitty.

8
00:02:19,650 --> 00:02:21,180
You're letting me hold you?

9
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:26,060
Oh, you have yellow eyes!

10
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:27,110
Are you hungry?

11
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:33,300
Let me see.

12
00:02:35,690 --> 00:02:36,500
So pretty.

13
00:02:37,530 --> 00:02:39,690
You're so comfy,
you've got your eyes closed.

14
00:02:39,690 --> 00:02:40,240
Are you hungry?

15
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,840
I'll take you home
and get you something to eat.

16
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:45,400
You're back.

17
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:50,300
Come on, time to eat.

18
00:02:53,090 --> 00:02:53,960
It seems to know you

19
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,630
pretty well.

20
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:58,160
Do you come here to feed it often?

21
00:02:58,340 --> 00:02:59,000
Yeah.

22
00:03:00,690 --> 00:03:02,250
When did you two meet?

23
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:04,150
I first saw it

24
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:05,500
on a rainy day.

25
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:07,960
It just showed up out of nowhere.

26
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,090
What a coincidence.

27
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:10,240
Do you remember?

28
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,250
We first met

29
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:12,400
on a rainy day, too.

30
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:18,000
Can I take it home?

31
00:03:19,610 --> 00:03:20,260
It has been free to roam outside

32
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:22,260
from the very beginning.

33
00:03:22,690 --> 00:03:23,460
I feel like it'd be better off

34
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:24,460
staying out here.

35
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,190
Fair enough.

36
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:29,400
So, what's its name?

37
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:31,430
Kitty.

38
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,090
Who names a cat that?

39
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:41,300
Then

40
00:03:42,430 --> 00:03:44,030
why don't you give her a name?

41
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:45,650
Me?

42
00:03:46,930 --> 00:03:48,500
How

43
00:03:48,530 --> 00:03:50,430
about Rainie?

44
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:52,360
We both met you

45
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,560
on rainy days.

46
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:56,590
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

47
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,800
Rainie.

48
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:59,990
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

49
00:03:57,930 --> 00:03:58,560
Rainie.

50
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,300
Rainie.

51
00:04:00,790 --> 00:04:03,200
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

52
00:04:01,090 --> 00:04:01,860
Hello, Rainie.

53
00:04:01,860 --> 00:04:02,690
I'm Shize.

54
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:06,420
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

55
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,190
I'm Lili.

56
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:10,420
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

57
00:04:07,650 --> 00:04:09,180
She seems to really like it.

58
00:04:09,750 --> 00:04:10,960
We're leaving now, Rainie.

59
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:13,080
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

60
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,090
Bye-bye.

61
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:16,380
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

62
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:20,240
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

63
00:04:21,950 --> 00:04:24,880
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

64
00:04:24,940 --> 00:04:27,100
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

65
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:29,950
I didn't have much to do at home today,

66
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:31,740
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

67
00:04:29,950 --> 00:04:32,240
so I did a little tidying up.

68
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:34,050
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

69
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:36,450
Go change your clothes.

70
00:04:35,130 --> 00:04:38,700
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

71
00:04:36,450 --> 00:04:38,580
I've got something good for you to eat.

72
00:04:38,870 --> 00:04:41,730
♪ To meet the moon ♪

73
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:44,690
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

74
00:04:44,159 --> 00:04:46,040
I put all your liquor away, too.

75
00:04:44,710 --> 00:04:47,600
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

76
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:51,790
♪ I just wanna stay with you ♪

77
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:49,760
Have some water.

78
00:04:52,110 --> 00:04:54,980
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

79
00:04:52,830 --> 00:04:54,290
Thanks for doing all this.

80
00:04:55,090 --> 00:04:58,830
♪ Love gives us all ♪

81
00:04:55,659 --> 00:04:56,560
It was nothing.

82
00:04:58,850 --> 00:05:01,910
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

83
00:04:59,159 --> 00:05:00,360
I'll go change, then.

84
00:05:01,930 --> 00:05:02,750
♪ You know ♪

85
00:05:02,770 --> 00:05:06,010
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

86
00:05:06,030 --> 00:05:08,840
♪ No matter how many times I say
I love you ♪

87
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:12,440
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

88
00:05:13,340 --> 00:05:18,240
♪ I could say it ten thousand times
and never tire ♪

89
00:05:31,250 --> 00:05:32,540
I couldn't get to the second floor,

90
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:33,190
but I wiped down

91
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:34,750
the rest of the place.

92
00:05:39,540 --> 00:05:41,040
W-What's wrong?

93
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:43,190
Nothing.

94
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:46,630
I'm sorry.

95
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:48,890
I-I shouldn't have taken the liberty.

96
00:05:50,110 --> 00:05:51,860
From now on,

97
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:55,409
I'll take care of the cleaning
and stuff myself.

98
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,890
I need to go back home after dinner

99
00:05:58,890 --> 00:05:59,750
to pick something up.

100
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:01,100
Then I'll come back.

101
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:01,750
Okay.

102
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:42,830
Look at you,

103
00:06:42,890 --> 00:06:43,659
rushing

104
00:06:43,659 --> 00:06:45,040
to give yourself to him.

105
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,300
I am not.

106
00:06:48,930 --> 00:06:50,730
Then why are you packing so fast?

107
00:06:50,930 --> 00:06:53,659
You've practically
emptied out your whole room.

108
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:57,500
Well, he invited me.

109
00:06:57,740 --> 00:06:58,930
If I turned him down,

110
00:06:58,930 --> 00:07:00,060
it'd seem

111
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:02,020
a little cold-hearted.

112
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:05,690
Cold-hearted?

113
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:11,360
I asked you to see a movie
the week before last,

114
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,460
and you said no.

115
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:14,540
Then I invited you to hot pot last week,

116
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:16,140
and you turned me down again.

117
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,320
You've really

118
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:20,600
broken my heart.

119
00:07:21,300 --> 00:07:23,600
I was studying for exams!

120
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:25,190
I didn't mean it.

121
00:07:25,350 --> 00:07:27,150
All right, I'm just teasing you.

122
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:30,300
But seriously,

123
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:32,510
don't move all your stuff over there.

124
00:07:32,690 --> 00:07:34,560
Leave yourself a way out.

125
00:07:34,890 --> 00:07:35,600
In case you two

126
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,890
get into a fight someday,

127
00:07:36,890 --> 00:07:38,550
you can always come back here.

128
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:41,290
It's better than ending up
on the streets, right?

129
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:42,430
Exactly.

130
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,500
You're the sweetest.

131
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:46,600
You'll always be my safe haven.

132
00:07:47,659 --> 00:07:48,630
Don't be mad.

133
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:51,390
Oh, and

134
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:52,830
if going back to campus

135
00:07:53,250 --> 00:07:54,690
is too much trouble,

136
00:07:54,690 --> 00:07:56,250
or you're too busy one day,

137
00:07:56,250 --> 00:07:57,650
you can always stay here.

138
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:00,950
Fu Zhengchu said

139
00:08:00,950 --> 00:08:02,130
the same thing today.

140
00:08:02,130 --> 00:08:03,360
He asked me to move in with him,

141
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,500
but I turned him down.

142
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:05,300
Why?

143
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:07,690
Don't you like him?

144
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:10,000
I do,

145
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:11,890
but I feel like

146
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:13,950
moving in together is a big step,

147
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:15,390
and we shouldn't rush into it.

148
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:16,250
Think about it.

149
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,890
When two people are dating,

150
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:18,640
they always want to show each other

151
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,500
their best side.

152
00:08:20,660 --> 00:08:22,300
But once they live together,

153
00:08:22,450 --> 00:08:24,160
all those little flaws

154
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,090
become impossible to hide.

155
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,240
Little flaws?

156
00:08:27,930 --> 00:08:28,390
Yeah.

157
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,900
Like,

158
00:08:30,100 --> 00:08:31,160
I might get up in the morning

159
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,289
without brushing my teeth
or washing my face,

160
00:08:32,289 --> 00:08:33,600
with my hair all messy

161
00:08:33,770 --> 00:08:35,100
me in sloppy clothes.

162
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:36,340
Or I might get too loud

163
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:37,549
when I'm gaming.

164
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,860
If he saw all that,

165
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:41,659
would he

166
00:08:43,250 --> 00:08:44,250
be disappointed?

167
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:45,960
Would he realize

168
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,460
I'm not the Tang Lin

169
00:08:47,460 --> 00:08:48,650
he imagined me to be?

170
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,110
Actually,

171
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,810
I have the same concerns.

172
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,460
That's why

173
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,430
it's a double-edged sword.

174
00:08:56,050 --> 00:08:58,180
Living together can bring you closer,

175
00:08:58,410 --> 00:08:59,280
but it also means

176
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:01,130
seeing each other

177
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,700
for who you really are,

178
00:09:02,890 --> 00:09:04,220
imperfections and all.

179
00:10:29,890 --> 00:10:32,050
We already have some at home, don't we?

180
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:35,430
Matching toothbrushes,

181
00:10:35,460 --> 00:10:36,290
matching slippers,

182
00:10:36,290 --> 00:10:37,350
matching pajamas.

183
00:10:37,530 --> 00:10:38,860
What's wrong with that?

184
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:03,030
Hello?

185
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,010
Hey, Yun Li.

186
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:04,690
Hello.

187
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:06,480
My final exam results are out.

188
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,810
I ranked 6th in my grade.

189
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:10,750
S-So what?

190
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:12,550
Don't play dumb!

191
00:11:12,740 --> 00:11:14,410
Didn't you promise me last time?

192
00:11:14,410 --> 00:11:16,170
You said if my grades improved,

193
00:11:16,170 --> 00:11:18,270
y-you'd book me a ticket to Nanwu.

194
00:11:18,290 --> 00:11:19,330
No way.

195
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:21,000
And when did I

196
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:22,150
ever say that?

197
00:11:22,150 --> 00:11:23,050
What I said last time

198
00:11:23,050 --> 00:11:24,630
was that I didn't have the money.

199
00:11:24,630 --> 00:11:26,220
Please, Li!

200
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:27,630
I already made plans with Shize.

201
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:29,270
He said I could borrow his drone.

202
00:11:29,270 --> 00:11:31,670
I might as well go pick it up
while I'm there.

203
00:11:32,270 --> 00:11:34,000
You promised Yun Ye your drone?

204
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:35,740
Book him a ticket.

205
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:36,720
I'll pay for it.

206
00:11:40,030 --> 00:11:41,550
Who are you talking to?

207
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,200
Are you with Shize?

208
00:11:43,750 --> 00:11:44,550
No, I'm not.

209
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:45,410
Li,

210
00:11:45,460 --> 00:11:46,410
thank Shize for me.

211
00:11:46,410 --> 00:11:47,550
Tell him I love him.

212
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:49,290
I won't interrupt your date.

213
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:50,620
Bye! I'm hanging up now.

214
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:55,630
You're way too indulgent with him.

215
00:11:56,030 --> 00:11:57,360
If he's someone you care about,

216
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,760
I'll care about him, too.

217
00:12:03,430 --> 00:12:04,680
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

218
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:20,550
It's only been 4 hours.

219
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:21,480
Miss me already?

220
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:22,390
Get lost.

221
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,200
Xia,

222
00:12:27,530 --> 00:12:28,720
d-do you think

223
00:12:28,860 --> 00:12:29,860
Fu Shize will

224
00:12:29,860 --> 00:12:31,050
mistreat our Lili?

225
00:12:31,780 --> 00:12:32,610
Don't worry.

226
00:12:32,630 --> 00:12:34,890
People tend to cherish their first love.

227
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,790
First love never lasts!

228
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,740
Those two have to stay together forever,

229
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:40,700
till they're old and gray.

230
00:12:41,340 --> 00:12:42,130
Tangy,

231
00:12:42,340 --> 00:12:44,130
we should stay together forever, too,

232
00:12:44,130 --> 00:12:45,250
till we're old and gray.

233
00:12:45,250 --> 00:12:47,000
Stop being so cheesy.

234
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,250
Hey, Lili.

235
00:12:58,370 --> 00:12:58,840
Tangy,

236
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,040
have you moved in yet?

237
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:00,790
Not yet.

238
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:01,780
What's wrong?

239
00:13:02,700 --> 00:13:03,500
Nothing.

240
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:04,500
I'll be going back to stay

241
00:13:04,500 --> 00:13:06,150
for a few days in a couple of days.

242
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:07,610
Did you two fight already?

243
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:08,980
Did you break up?

244
00:13:09,130 --> 00:13:10,050
No,

245
00:13:10,500 --> 00:13:11,550
my little brother is coming.

246
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:13,550
I don't want them to find out so soon.

247
00:13:15,290 --> 00:13:18,090
So you're taking
your relationship underground?

248
00:13:19,290 --> 00:13:20,030
Think about it.

249
00:13:20,030 --> 00:13:22,000
If my dad found out,

250
00:13:22,030 --> 00:13:22,890
he'd come over

251
00:13:22,890 --> 00:13:24,130
and tear me limb from limb!

252
00:13:24,130 --> 00:13:25,550
Fair point.

253
00:13:26,340 --> 00:13:27,130
Bye-bye.

254
00:13:34,050 --> 00:13:35,550
Fu Zhengchu, I'm warning you.

255
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:36,960
Lili's little brother

256
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,750
is coming in a couple of days.

257
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:38,750
Keep your mouth shut

258
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:39,630
when he gets here.

259
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:41,160
Don't say anything stupid.

260
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:42,240
Relax.

261
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,460
I'm the best at keeping secrets.

262
00:13:47,890 --> 00:13:49,020
Do you believe that?

263
00:14:17,170 --> 00:14:17,790
Yun Li,

264
00:14:18,150 --> 00:14:20,210
let me pick up Yun Ye
when he gets here.

265
00:14:20,790 --> 00:14:21,530
I have two movie tickets

266
00:14:21,530 --> 00:14:22,870
for Saturday night.

267
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:25,150
Yunyi has tutoring that evening,

268
00:14:25,150 --> 00:14:26,950
so it'd be a waste not to use them.

269
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:31,030
Then I'll ask Yun Ye

270
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:32,150
if he wants to go.

271
00:14:39,930 --> 00:14:41,930
I've been wanting to see this movie.

272
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,610
Would you like to go with me?

273
00:14:49,390 --> 00:14:50,190
What's wrong?

274
00:14:51,630 --> 00:14:54,090
Yin Yucheng asked me to go
to a movie with him.

275
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,410
And?

276
00:15:00,380 --> 00:15:01,840
Let me text him back first.

277
00:15:05,340 --> 00:15:05,990
Wait.

278
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,080
My boyfriend isn't comfortable with me

279
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,840
going out alone with another guy.

280
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,860
Sorry.

281
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,000
Yunyi,

282
00:15:25,790 --> 00:15:26,960
did Yun Ye really tell you

283
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:28,760
his sister isn't seeing anyone?

284
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:29,630
Yeah.

285
00:15:32,750 --> 00:15:33,560
Yucheng.

286
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:35,460
Is it possible

287
00:15:35,890 --> 00:15:37,130
that Yun Ye just doesn't know

288
00:15:37,130 --> 00:15:38,930
his sister is in a relationship?

289
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:44,230
Should I delete him

290
00:15:44,230 --> 00:15:45,540
on WeChat?

291
00:15:45,790 --> 00:15:46,170
Do it.

292
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:52,860
But Yun Ye and his sister

293
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:53,700
are really close.

294
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:54,740
If I just delete him like that,

295
00:15:54,740 --> 00:15:55,530
won't I seem difficult

296
00:15:55,530 --> 00:15:56,650
to get along with?

297
00:15:59,030 --> 00:16:00,690
You're hesitating that much?

298
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:04,430
You deleted me
without a second thought back then.

299
00:16:06,290 --> 00:16:08,000
Y-You knew back then?

300
00:16:09,660 --> 00:16:11,520
Then why didn't you say anything?

301
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,460
I agonized over it

302
00:16:20,290 --> 00:16:22,440
for ages before deleting you.

303
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:23,860
I didn't want to, either.

304
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:25,600
Really?

305
00:16:25,630 --> 00:16:26,220
Mm-hmm.

306
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:31,700
Sorry,

307
00:16:31,820 --> 00:16:33,100
I got the wrong idea.

308
00:16:36,940 --> 00:16:38,470
At least he knows his place.

309
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:41,440
So, should I still delete him on WeChat?

310
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:42,360
No need.

311
00:16:49,500 --> 00:16:51,460
You said you'd fly the drone with me.

312
00:16:51,460 --> 00:16:53,750
Come fly with me after work, okay?

313
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:55,290
Mm-hmm.

314
00:17:24,790 --> 00:17:25,589
Lili,

315
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:27,480
did you get it?

316
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:30,460
Yeah.

317
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,940
Your signature move,

318
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,070
the Cube Roll.

319
00:17:36,650 --> 00:17:37,590
That's how

320
00:17:38,070 --> 00:17:40,000
you won me over back then.

321
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:44,140
Remember the final

322
00:17:44,140 --> 00:17:45,380
of the national competition?

323
00:17:45,380 --> 00:17:46,140
You beat your opponent

324
00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:47,140
with that move.

325
00:17:47,270 --> 00:17:48,500
The whole crowd went wild,

326
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:50,760
and I was cheering right along with them.

327
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:55,330
Did you

328
00:17:55,330 --> 00:17:56,860
keep competing after that?

329
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,270
Shize,

330
00:18:06,570 --> 00:18:08,000
I often feel

331
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:10,740
like you're not

332
00:18:10,230 --> 00:18:12,050
♪ A thin short line ♪

333
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:12,740
quite the same person you used to be.

334
00:18:12,070 --> 00:18:15,690
♪ Two hearts intertwined ♪

335
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:19,420
♪ Which way to go ♪

336
00:18:19,710 --> 00:18:22,690
♪ Might be simpler so ♪

337
00:18:19,940 --> 00:18:20,740
So...

338
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:25,810
I just thought the old you,

339
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:26,480
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

340
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:30,500
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

341
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:28,160
so confident and radiant,

342
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:29,680
was amazing.

343
00:18:31,570 --> 00:18:36,870
♪ Hesitant feet—which side
should I stand on ♪

344
00:18:35,590 --> 00:18:36,180
Well,

345
00:18:37,070 --> 00:18:38,830
you're amazing now, too.

346
00:18:39,370 --> 00:18:42,050
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

347
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:41,700
I just don't know

348
00:18:41,980 --> 00:18:43,290
what you've been through.

349
00:18:42,070 --> 00:18:43,660
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

350
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,480
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

351
00:18:45,150 --> 00:18:46,450
Knowing me, I'm not very good

352
00:18:45,510 --> 00:18:48,480
♪ This damp murmur ♪

353
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,900
at asking questions.

354
00:18:48,770 --> 00:18:53,230
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

355
00:18:50,290 --> 00:18:52,980
But it's okay
if you're not ready to talk about it.

356
00:18:52,980 --> 00:18:54,070
I just feel like

357
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:57,250
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

358
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:59,000
it's not right for me
not to understand how you feel.

359
00:18:57,450 --> 00:19:00,440
♪ Resentment takes root inside ♪

360
00:19:00,970 --> 00:19:06,300
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

361
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:03,590
I want to be the person

362
00:19:03,590 --> 00:19:05,050
who understands you best.

363
00:19:06,490 --> 00:19:08,180
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

364
00:19:08,210 --> 00:19:11,730
♪ Maybe someday ♪

365
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:14,350
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

366
00:19:14,690 --> 00:19:21,400
♪ I hope you write
the ending of our tale ♪

367
00:19:14,940 --> 00:19:15,900
I'm sorry, Lili.

368
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,000
I...

369
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:24,260
I'm not ready to talk about it yet.

370
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,400
Can I tell you

371
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:31,100
when I'm ready?

372
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:34,290
It's okay.

373
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:35,550
I'll wait.

374
00:19:44,530 --> 00:19:46,510
Nanwu is so beautiful!

375
00:19:46,980 --> 00:19:48,310
Li, no wonder you don't want

376
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:49,310
to go back to Xifu.

377
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:51,100
I'll go to college here, too.

378
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:52,550
What are you talking about?

379
00:19:52,550 --> 00:19:53,850
If you and I both move to Nanwu,

380
00:19:53,850 --> 00:19:55,500
what about Dad and Mom?

381
00:19:55,670 --> 00:19:57,300
They're not kids anymore.

382
00:19:57,330 --> 00:19:59,190
They can take care of themselves.

383
00:19:59,810 --> 00:20:00,480
Shize,

384
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,290
can I see

385
00:20:01,290 --> 00:20:02,420
your drone first?

386
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:03,530
Sure.

387
00:20:04,050 --> 00:20:05,780
Let's head back to the guesthouse first.

388
00:20:05,780 --> 00:20:07,130
Shize is busy,

389
00:20:07,350 --> 00:20:08,140
and he's already

390
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:09,590
going out of his way
to pick you up today.

391
00:20:09,590 --> 00:20:10,740
I'll bring the drone

392
00:20:10,740 --> 00:20:11,980
over to you later.

393
00:20:12,290 --> 00:20:14,660
But I want to see the drone first.

394
00:20:14,830 --> 00:20:16,550
And I have so many questions to ask.

395
00:20:16,550 --> 00:20:18,050
Didn't you want to go to the beach?

396
00:20:18,050 --> 00:20:19,050
The weather's lovely.

397
00:20:19,050 --> 00:20:20,240
Why don't I take you there?

398
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,900
What's so fun about the beach?

399
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:22,700
Shize is so busy,

400
00:20:22,700 --> 00:20:24,530
and he finally has some free time.

401
00:20:24,530 --> 00:20:26,290
I want to see the drone first.

402
00:20:26,790 --> 00:20:28,160
Shize, please?

403
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:32,090
It's still early.

404
00:20:32,530 --> 00:20:34,050
Let's take him home
to see the drone first.

405
00:20:34,050 --> 00:20:35,030
Thanks, Shize.

406
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:49,750
Take off your shoes and put on slippers.

407
00:20:49,750 --> 00:20:50,570
Don't be rude.

408
00:20:55,750 --> 00:20:58,080
It's fine.
You don't have to take them off.

409
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:06,940
Take off your jacket.

410
00:21:08,330 --> 00:21:09,000
Shize,

411
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,660
your house is huge!

412
00:21:10,830 --> 00:21:11,790
Make yourself at home.

413
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:12,270
Okay.

414
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Don't touch that.

415
00:21:16,590 --> 00:21:17,400
Put it back.

416
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,940
Find somewhere to sit.

417
00:21:23,830 --> 00:21:25,460
Yun Ye, what would you like to drink?

418
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:26,330
Anything's fine.

419
00:21:26,330 --> 00:21:27,190
Thanks, Shize.

420
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:30,980
By the way,

421
00:21:30,980 --> 00:21:32,090
where's your drone?

422
00:21:32,090 --> 00:21:32,920
Can I go see it?

423
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,200
It's inside the room.

424
00:21:34,500 --> 00:21:35,290
This room?

425
00:21:35,810 --> 00:21:36,350
Yun Ye.

426
00:21:37,830 --> 00:21:38,940
T-That room.

427
00:21:41,660 --> 00:21:43,290
-Which room, Li?
-This one.

428
00:21:48,500 --> 00:21:50,250
This is so cool.

429
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:54,370
I said you could look, not mess with it.

430
00:22:00,460 --> 00:22:02,990
You're dating someone
and keeping it from me?

431
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:06,250
H-How did you find out?

432
00:22:06,750 --> 00:22:08,110
How else?

433
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:09,250
You were treating me

434
00:22:09,250 --> 00:22:11,180
like you were the lady of the house.

435
00:22:12,460 --> 00:22:13,660
Grown-up business.

436
00:22:13,660 --> 00:22:15,250
Kids should stay out of it.

437
00:22:17,350 --> 00:22:19,330
Did you spend
New Year's Eve with him, too?

438
00:22:19,330 --> 00:22:20,190
So what if I did?

439
00:22:21,590 --> 00:22:22,830
Oh, Yun Li,

440
00:22:22,900 --> 00:22:23,900
you're so busted.

441
00:22:24,700 --> 00:22:26,500
Not only are you dating someone,

442
00:22:26,660 --> 00:22:28,260
you're living with him, too.

443
00:22:28,540 --> 00:22:29,190
No wonder

444
00:22:29,220 --> 00:22:30,940
you kept refusing to let me come to Nanwu.

445
00:22:30,940 --> 00:22:32,530
You've got a man
and forgotten your own brother!

446
00:22:32,530 --> 00:22:33,790
Are you pointing at me?

447
00:22:35,090 --> 00:22:36,150
Give me your phone.

448
00:22:37,330 --> 00:22:37,860
What for?

449
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:42,140
Why do you want my phone?

450
00:22:42,140 --> 00:22:43,790
Give me back my New Year's
red envelope money.

451
00:22:43,790 --> 00:22:44,370
In your dreams!

452
00:22:44,370 --> 00:22:45,590
H-Hey, don't—

453
00:22:45,590 --> 00:22:46,160
Give it back!

454
00:22:46,160 --> 00:22:46,770
If you don't give it back to me,

455
00:22:46,770 --> 00:22:47,750
I'll tell Dad.

456
00:22:48,090 --> 00:22:49,290
Yun Ye, you...

457
00:22:49,290 --> 00:22:50,290
Brother-in-law!

458
00:22:50,420 --> 00:22:51,750
Brother-in-law, save me!

459
00:22:51,750 --> 00:22:52,220
You...

460
00:22:55,090 --> 00:22:55,830
Yun Ye!

461
00:22:59,960 --> 00:23:01,750
Yun Li, you're way too violent.

462
00:23:04,530 --> 00:23:05,330
Even

463
00:23:05,500 --> 00:23:07,330
my brother-in-law
acts more like a lady than you do.

464
00:23:07,330 --> 00:23:08,850
You sure changed your tune fast.

465
00:23:08,850 --> 00:23:09,290
Taking

466
00:23:09,290 --> 00:23:11,350
your brother-in-law's side already?

467
00:23:11,350 --> 00:23:13,400
Come on, he's tall, handsome,

468
00:23:13,420 --> 00:23:14,510
and nice.

469
00:23:17,500 --> 00:23:18,360
What about you?

470
00:23:19,550 --> 00:23:20,750
What's wrong with me?

471
00:23:22,830 --> 00:23:24,030
What's that look for?

472
00:23:24,350 --> 00:23:25,240
But Yun Li,

473
00:23:26,260 --> 00:23:27,060
what if

474
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:28,980
Dad finds out?

475
00:23:28,980 --> 00:23:30,310
What are you going to do?

476
00:23:30,330 --> 00:23:31,700
I'm old enough.

477
00:23:31,700 --> 00:23:33,090
to date whoever I want.

478
00:23:36,290 --> 00:23:38,460
Y-You'd better not tell him just yet.

479
00:23:39,350 --> 00:23:39,880
Okay.

480
00:23:44,770 --> 00:23:45,440
I can't let this go.

481
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,140
Call them

482
00:23:46,140 --> 00:23:47,600
and tell them to come back.

483
00:23:48,660 --> 00:23:49,180
What?

484
00:23:49,700 --> 00:23:51,050
You're not gonna call?

485
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,930
Fine, I'll do it.

486
00:24:02,150 --> 00:24:03,160
[Dad]

487
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:07,380
Does Dad

488
00:24:07,380 --> 00:24:09,140
have a tracker installed
on my phone or something?

489
00:24:09,140 --> 00:24:10,480
Speak of the devil!

490
00:24:10,900 --> 00:24:12,200
Li, please, please,

491
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:12,790
please help me out this once.

492
00:24:12,790 --> 00:24:14,030
You came to Nanwu
without telling Dad?

493
00:24:14,030 --> 00:24:15,000
If I'd told him,

494
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,250
how would I have gotten here?

495
00:24:16,250 --> 00:24:17,140
Please, Li,

496
00:24:17,140 --> 00:24:17,700
help me out this once.

497
00:24:17,700 --> 00:24:18,530
This is your problem.

498
00:24:18,530 --> 00:24:19,550
I'm not helping you this time.

499
00:24:19,550 --> 00:24:20,850
If you won't help me,

500
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:22,110
I'll tell Dad

501
00:24:22,110 --> 00:24:23,440
you're dating someone.

502
00:24:23,500 --> 00:24:24,240
All right, all right!

503
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:25,460
So that's
how you're gonna play it, Yun Ye?

504
00:24:25,460 --> 00:24:26,050
Fine.

505
00:24:26,050 --> 00:24:26,700
Go ahead.

506
00:24:26,700 --> 00:24:27,550
Let's go down together, then.

507
00:24:27,550 --> 00:24:28,250
If I'm going down,
you're coming with me.

508
00:24:28,250 --> 00:24:29,310
Go ahead. Tell him!

509
00:24:29,530 --> 00:24:31,310
Li, please, Li.

510
00:24:31,310 --> 00:24:31,940
Come on, we're

511
00:24:31,940 --> 00:24:33,640
in this together now.

512
00:24:34,180 --> 00:24:34,660
Look,

513
00:24:34,980 --> 00:24:35,510
you can't just throw me overboard

514
00:24:35,510 --> 00:24:36,940
to feed the sharks!

515
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,900
Look, I'm still young.

516
00:24:39,090 --> 00:24:40,530
I've got a whole workbook of wrong answers
to take care of,

517
00:24:40,530 --> 00:24:42,100
not to mention a virtual pet to feed.

518
00:24:42,100 --> 00:24:43,900
Please, please, please!

519
00:24:46,110 --> 00:24:47,330
Yun Ye, where have you been?

520
00:24:47,330 --> 00:24:49,330
Why did it take you so long to answer?

521
00:24:49,850 --> 00:24:50,460
Hello?

522
00:24:50,610 --> 00:24:51,330
Yun Li?

523
00:24:52,360 --> 00:24:52,900
Were you the one

524
00:24:52,900 --> 00:24:54,180
who bought him a plane ticket to Nanwu?

525
00:24:54,180 --> 00:24:56,090
So he went there to see you.

526
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:58,010
It's bad enough
that you went to Nanwu on your own,

527
00:24:58,010 --> 00:24:59,180
but now you've got your brother
coming to join you?

528
00:24:59,180 --> 00:25:00,920
What kind of sister are you?

529
00:25:01,010 --> 00:25:02,830
He's on break, so he's just coming
to stay with me for a few days.

530
00:25:02,830 --> 00:25:04,290
I'll take good care of him.

531
00:25:04,290 --> 00:25:06,220
He just got placed in the top class,

532
00:25:06,550 --> 00:25:08,290
and he's about to start
his final year of high school.

533
00:25:08,290 --> 00:25:08,900
Do you have any idea how crucial

534
00:25:08,900 --> 00:25:10,590
this time is for him?

535
00:25:10,730 --> 00:25:11,710
He's got no time to go out

536
00:25:11,710 --> 00:25:12,570
and have fun!

537
00:25:12,660 --> 00:25:13,200
Tell him to get his butt back

538
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:14,220
here today!

539
00:25:14,740 --> 00:25:15,640
My suitcase

540
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:17,100
is full of exam prep books.

541
00:25:17,500 --> 00:25:18,810
I'm only staying for a few days.

542
00:25:18,810 --> 00:25:19,460
Mom,

543
00:25:19,490 --> 00:25:20,490
talk to Dad for me.

544
00:25:20,940 --> 00:25:22,330
Otherwise, I'm not going back either.

545
00:25:22,330 --> 00:25:22,740
Oh, so now

546
00:25:22,740 --> 00:25:23,550
that you've gotten yourself into trouble,

547
00:25:23,550 --> 00:25:24,740
you go running to someone for backup?

548
00:25:24,740 --> 00:25:25,810
It's not gonna work!

549
00:25:25,810 --> 00:25:26,420
Tell me,

550
00:25:26,570 --> 00:25:27,030
did you learn this

551
00:25:27,030 --> 00:25:28,000
from your sister?

552
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:32,600
Going behind my back and doing whatever
you want first, then telling me afterward!

553
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:34,000
Lili,

554
00:25:34,380 --> 00:25:36,170
your brother's never
been to Nanwu before.

555
00:25:36,170 --> 00:25:37,080
It's good for him to go and have some fun

556
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:38,130
for a few days.

557
00:25:38,190 --> 00:25:39,390
Take good care of him.

558
00:25:40,530 --> 00:25:41,330
Yun Ye,

559
00:25:41,460 --> 00:25:43,790
listen to your sister
while you're there,

560
00:25:43,820 --> 00:25:44,600
and have fun.

561
00:25:44,630 --> 00:25:45,530
You two can come back together

562
00:25:45,530 --> 00:25:46,660
before the New Year.

563
00:25:48,850 --> 00:25:50,510
I-I wasn't finished!

564
00:25:50,510 --> 00:25:51,510
Why'd you hang up?

565
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:55,160
Did Mom really manage
to talk Dad around?

566
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:56,530
No idea.

567
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,440
Whatever.

568
00:25:58,440 --> 00:26:00,140
At least we got through today.

569
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:02,180
But with Dad's hair-trigger temper,

570
00:26:02,180 --> 00:26:03,580
this can't go on forever.

571
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:05,940
I can already see

572
00:26:05,940 --> 00:26:06,810
my future.

573
00:26:08,110 --> 00:26:09,770
Am I gonna end up just like you?

574
00:26:10,070 --> 00:26:11,180
I'm warning you.

575
00:26:11,220 --> 00:26:12,270
Watch yourself.

576
00:26:13,240 --> 00:26:13,980
When you get back,

577
00:26:13,980 --> 00:26:15,110
focus on your studies

578
00:26:15,110 --> 00:26:16,510
and don't make Dad angry.

579
00:26:16,740 --> 00:26:17,740
Otherwise, he'll cut you off

580
00:26:17,740 --> 00:26:18,870
financially again.

581
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:21,030
You're one to talk.

582
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:23,240
If Dad finds out

583
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,840
you're dating a guy in Nanwu,

584
00:26:25,010 --> 00:26:26,240
he might even fly here

585
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:27,330
to break your legs.

586
00:26:30,640 --> 00:26:31,980
Li, how much are you making these days

587
00:26:31,980 --> 00:26:33,510
from your content creation

588
00:26:33,510 --> 00:26:35,200
and internship?

589
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,000
Why do you ask?

590
00:26:36,610 --> 00:26:37,940
You should save up more.

591
00:26:38,010 --> 00:26:39,270
If Dad finds out,

592
00:26:39,270 --> 00:26:40,640
he'll kick you out.

593
00:26:41,640 --> 00:26:42,480
Would you stop

594
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:43,510
giving me

595
00:26:43,510 --> 00:26:44,640
ridiculous advice?

596
00:26:47,940 --> 00:26:48,870
Have some fruit.

597
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:49,460
Okay.

598
00:26:49,460 --> 00:26:50,190
You two chat.

599
00:26:50,240 --> 00:26:51,570
I'll go have some fruit.

600
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:54,140
There's more on the dining table.

601
00:26:54,140 --> 00:26:55,670
Okay, thanks, bro-in-law.

602
00:26:58,400 --> 00:26:59,400
"Bro-in-law"?

603
00:27:00,420 --> 00:27:02,150
What are you two talking about?

604
00:27:02,900 --> 00:27:04,940
You heard all that?

605
00:27:06,100 --> 00:27:07,600
Heard what?

606
00:27:14,940 --> 00:27:15,770
Fu Shize,

607
00:27:17,620 --> 00:27:19,420
I haven't told my family

608
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,810
about us dating.

609
00:27:23,240 --> 00:27:24,980
My dad has a bad temper

610
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:27,050
and is really controlling.

611
00:27:27,510 --> 00:27:28,830
You might want

612
00:27:28,830 --> 00:27:30,490
to prepare yourself for that.

613
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:33,480
M-My dad

614
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:35,140
is pretty great in other ways.

615
00:27:35,530 --> 00:27:37,060
He just doesn't really know

616
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:39,640
how to love his own kids.

617
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:46,070
I'm not

618
00:27:46,070 --> 00:27:47,330
dating your dad.

619
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:53,640
Do you want me to meet him?

620
00:27:54,310 --> 00:27:55,110
No...

621
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:58,720
I just wanted to give you a heads-up.

622
00:27:59,740 --> 00:28:00,640
My dad's

623
00:28:01,070 --> 00:28:02,270
really controlling,

624
00:28:02,440 --> 00:28:04,440
and I can't win an argument with him.

625
00:28:05,440 --> 00:28:07,940
And about my family...

626
00:28:08,510 --> 00:28:10,740
My parents only graduated
from vocational school.

627
00:28:10,740 --> 00:28:12,880
I'm still just an intern,

628
00:28:13,330 --> 00:28:15,140
but I can support myself now.

629
00:28:15,330 --> 00:28:16,230
Things will be even better

630
00:28:16,230 --> 00:28:18,430
once I graduate and get a full-time job.

631
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:26,640
Lili,

632
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:28,750
all I care about

633
00:28:28,750 --> 00:28:30,350
is the kind of person you are.

634
00:28:31,220 --> 00:28:32,240
We'll face

635
00:28:33,420 --> 00:28:35,280
whatever comes our way together.

636
00:28:36,510 --> 00:28:37,380
Nothing else

637
00:28:38,380 --> 00:28:39,180
matters.

638
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:58,420
Yunyi.

639
00:29:00,460 --> 00:29:02,260
Have you been waiting here long?

640
00:29:06,830 --> 00:29:08,030
Where's your sister?

641
00:29:09,140 --> 00:29:10,680
She dropped me off nearby with Shize,

642
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,480
then left.

643
00:29:12,510 --> 00:29:13,510
What about your brother?

644
00:29:13,510 --> 00:29:14,570
He went home too.

645
00:29:15,640 --> 00:29:17,380
Your brother knows what's up.

646
00:29:19,010 --> 00:29:19,810
What?

647
00:29:20,830 --> 00:29:21,640
Nothing.

648
00:29:23,610 --> 00:29:24,610
I think my brother

649
00:29:25,110 --> 00:29:27,510
was just worried things would get awkward.

650
00:29:30,900 --> 00:29:32,830
The view from up here is beautiful.

651
00:29:34,510 --> 00:29:35,660
Can you tell me

652
00:29:35,660 --> 00:29:36,860
your zodiac sign now?

653
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:38,480
Find it on the star chart.

654
00:29:38,810 --> 00:29:40,610
It's right next to Sagittarius.

655
00:29:41,570 --> 00:29:42,380
Okay.

656
00:29:43,310 --> 00:29:44,270
Sagittarius...

657
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:51,630
He's holding a bow and arrow.

658
00:29:52,080 --> 00:29:53,610
The direction his arrow points

659
00:29:53,610 --> 00:29:55,070
is where my zodiac sign is.

660
00:29:55,090 --> 00:29:56,350
Let's see...

661
00:29:59,830 --> 00:30:00,770
Scorpio!

662
00:30:22,610 --> 00:30:23,640
By the way, Yun Ye,

663
00:30:24,010 --> 00:30:26,140
there's something I wanted to ask you.

664
00:30:27,610 --> 00:30:30,030
I think those postcards

665
00:30:30,030 --> 00:30:32,010
my classmates wrote me

666
00:30:32,270 --> 00:30:34,130
were all in the same handwriting,

667
00:30:34,420 --> 00:30:36,680
but I couldn't tell whose it was.

668
00:30:37,070 --> 00:30:38,030
Do you know?

669
00:30:40,500 --> 00:30:42,550
I'll go ask around your class

670
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:43,500
for you.

671
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:45,330
Okay.

672
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:53,900
I have a gift for you.

673
00:30:54,010 --> 00:30:54,940
Thanks.

674
00:30:56,910 --> 00:30:59,110
[To: Yun Ye]
[From: Class 15 of Grade 11]

675
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:01,920
Open it when you get back.

676
00:31:03,030 --> 00:31:03,530
Okay.

677
00:31:13,570 --> 00:31:15,570
What did you rank in the final exams?

678
00:31:16,510 --> 00:31:17,810
Sixth in the grade.

679
00:31:18,010 --> 00:31:18,870
What about you?

680
00:31:19,220 --> 00:31:20,380
Tenth in the grade.

681
00:31:23,610 --> 00:31:25,900
I really feel bad for your classmates.

682
00:31:26,430 --> 00:31:28,020
You're not even taking
the national college entrance exam,

683
00:31:28,020 --> 00:31:29,880
and you're still so competitive.

684
00:31:30,010 --> 00:31:33,240
Who says I'm not taking
the national college entrance exam?

685
00:31:33,240 --> 00:31:35,100
Aren't you going abroad to study?

686
00:31:35,530 --> 00:31:36,660
I've made up my mind.

687
00:31:36,830 --> 00:31:38,030
I'm staying in China.

688
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:39,680
Why?

689
00:31:41,070 --> 00:31:43,070
I guess I don't really like

690
00:31:43,070 --> 00:31:45,000
the environment abroad that much.

691
00:31:48,970 --> 00:31:50,830
Are you worried you won't adjust?

692
00:31:51,640 --> 00:31:54,380
Phones and delivery services

693
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:56,570
are so advanced these days.

694
00:31:56,570 --> 00:31:57,640
It's really convenient.

695
00:31:57,640 --> 00:31:58,510
You can still

696
00:31:58,510 --> 00:32:00,040
get Chinese food overseas.

697
00:32:00,220 --> 00:32:01,220
You can make

698
00:32:01,610 --> 00:32:03,410
plenty of Chinese friends, too,

699
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:06,170
and even watch
the Spring Festival Gala live.

700
00:32:06,740 --> 00:32:07,930
But

701
00:32:08,310 --> 00:32:09,640
they don't have...

702
00:32:11,380 --> 00:32:12,330
Don't have what?

703
00:32:15,540 --> 00:32:18,270
Are you worried
they don't have QR code payments?

704
00:32:23,160 --> 00:32:24,750
No, that's not it.

705
00:32:27,180 --> 00:32:29,180
Then what do we have here

706
00:32:29,770 --> 00:32:31,570
that they don't have over there?

707
00:32:32,770 --> 00:32:34,240
You're so dense.

708
00:32:39,810 --> 00:32:41,290
If you're not going abroad,

709
00:32:41,290 --> 00:32:43,020
won't your brother be furious?

710
00:32:43,030 --> 00:32:44,640
I'm grown up now.

711
00:32:45,010 --> 00:32:47,210
I've always done what my family wanted.

712
00:32:47,440 --> 00:32:50,240
This time, I want to be brave
and make my own choice.

713
00:32:51,460 --> 00:32:52,500
I'm with you!

714
00:32:54,380 --> 00:32:55,640
Which university do you want to apply to?

715
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:57,170
I can help you figure it out.

716
00:32:57,940 --> 00:32:59,610
I really like Xifu.

717
00:33:00,270 --> 00:33:01,510
I want to go to XUST.

718
00:33:02,920 --> 00:33:04,320
XUST is a great university!

719
00:33:04,320 --> 00:33:05,590
I like XUST, too.

720
00:33:22,340 --> 00:33:25,200
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

721
00:33:26,940 --> 00:33:28,010
Why's it so quiet today?

722
00:33:28,010 --> 00:33:29,420
Did everyone go on dates?

723
00:33:30,310 --> 00:33:32,790
Even the flies are flying off in pairs.

724
00:33:38,390 --> 00:33:39,650
Since it's so quiet today,

725
00:33:39,650 --> 00:33:41,310
let's go out and have some fun.

726
00:33:41,750 --> 00:33:42,360
A movie?

727
00:33:45,980 --> 00:33:46,590
KTV?

728
00:33:47,380 --> 00:33:48,180
Boring.

729
00:33:48,510 --> 00:33:49,830
Got any other ideas?

730
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,570
How about ice skating?

731
00:33:54,610 --> 00:33:55,510
How's that any different

732
00:33:55,510 --> 00:33:56,930
from your usual skateboarding?

733
00:33:56,930 --> 00:33:58,340
Am I just gonna sit there

734
00:33:58,370 --> 00:33:59,960
and watch you show off?

735
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:04,270
Good point.

736
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:09,920
How about camping?

737
00:34:09,980 --> 00:34:11,010
We could fish,

738
00:34:11,010 --> 00:34:13,110
and if we catch anything,
I could grill it for you.

739
00:34:13,110 --> 00:34:14,610
Then you can see

740
00:34:14,610 --> 00:34:16,340
what Chef Fu can do on the grill.

741
00:34:16,440 --> 00:34:17,230
Camping?

742
00:34:18,010 --> 00:34:18,980
We'd have to stay overnight?

743
00:34:18,980 --> 00:34:20,420
Of course. Going there and coming back

744
00:34:20,420 --> 00:34:21,280
the same day would be so boring.

745
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:23,170
That'd defeat the whole point of camping.

746
00:34:23,170 --> 00:34:24,420
In one tent?

747
00:34:26,030 --> 00:34:26,840
No way.

748
00:34:28,739 --> 00:34:29,570
Why not?

749
00:34:29,940 --> 00:34:32,739
I don't want to give you a chance
to make a move on me.

750
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:36,630
How is that making a move on you?

751
00:34:36,630 --> 00:34:37,380
Look,

752
00:34:37,380 --> 00:34:38,840
camping out in the wilderness
can be dangerous.

753
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:39,340
We'd have to share a tent

754
00:34:39,340 --> 00:34:40,570
for me to keep you safe

755
00:34:40,570 --> 00:34:42,070
out there.

756
00:34:45,920 --> 00:34:47,710
So what do you say we do instead?

757
00:34:53,170 --> 00:34:54,980
Why are you looking at me like that?

758
00:34:54,980 --> 00:34:56,440
You're making me nervous.

759
00:35:02,500 --> 00:35:03,050
So what did she give you

760
00:35:03,050 --> 00:35:04,300
in the end?

761
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:05,880
I don't know.

762
00:35:06,570 --> 00:35:09,010
But I wanna wait
until I'm back in Xifu to open it.

763
00:35:09,010 --> 00:35:10,870
It'll feel more special that way.

764
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:12,400
But listen,

765
00:35:13,950 --> 00:35:15,910
the wrapping on her gift

766
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:18,490
was exactly the same
as the one I used for hers.

767
00:35:19,610 --> 00:35:20,740
So you finally admit

768
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:22,110
it wasn't the whole class

769
00:35:22,110 --> 00:35:24,110
who made those postcards together?

770
00:35:24,930 --> 00:35:25,870
Look at you,

771
00:35:25,900 --> 00:35:27,110
all smug and pleased with yourself!

772
00:35:27,110 --> 00:35:28,310
Tone it down a little.

773
00:35:28,660 --> 00:35:30,640
There's something else I wanna tell you.

774
00:35:30,640 --> 00:35:32,180
Yunyi knows

775
00:35:32,210 --> 00:35:34,610
I was the one
who wrote all those postcards.

776
00:35:36,530 --> 00:35:37,920
You know what that means?

777
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:39,260
She didn't stop me.

778
00:35:39,880 --> 00:35:41,010
She didn't stop you?

779
00:35:42,570 --> 00:35:44,280
You're really getting in

780
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:45,630
one last daydream before nightfall.

781
00:35:45,630 --> 00:35:47,630
What do you mean, before nightfall?

782
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:49,280
What's wrong with dreaming at night?

783
00:35:49,280 --> 00:35:51,070
Because then it's just a dream,
not a daydream.

784
00:35:51,070 --> 00:35:52,510
Look at you, getting all worked up!

785
00:35:52,510 --> 00:35:53,320
Did I hit a nerve?

786
00:35:53,320 --> 00:35:53,880
What nerve?
You trying to get under my skin?

787
00:35:53,880 --> 00:35:54,960
-Someone's jealous!
-What's wrong with daytime, huh?

788
00:35:54,960 --> 00:35:55,610
You and your—

789
00:35:55,610 --> 00:35:56,230
You're definitely triggered.

790
00:35:56,230 --> 00:35:57,420
Don't smash my eggs!

791
00:35:58,500 --> 00:35:59,260
You keep picking up these phrases

792
00:35:59,260 --> 00:36:00,510
and using them on your own sister.

793
00:36:00,510 --> 00:36:01,980
Wait, it's just the two of us today?

794
00:36:01,980 --> 00:36:04,310
Shize is browsing the fresh food section.

795
00:36:04,380 --> 00:36:05,130
I didn't even tell him

796
00:36:05,130 --> 00:36:05,880
we were here.

797
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:06,810
Here, take this.

798
00:36:06,940 --> 00:36:07,600
I'll get it.

799
00:36:11,160 --> 00:36:12,890
Why is it all Shanghai bok choy?

800
00:36:16,670 --> 00:36:17,480
Hello?

801
00:36:18,010 --> 00:36:19,340
Where are you now?

802
00:36:20,020 --> 00:36:22,210
I'm in the produce section.

803
00:36:23,760 --> 00:36:24,940
I'll be over in a bit.

804
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:25,840
Okay.

805
00:36:28,110 --> 00:36:28,610
Bye-bye.

806
00:36:28,610 --> 00:36:30,210
"Where are you now?"

807
00:36:30,210 --> 00:36:31,480
"I'm in the produce section.

808
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:32,650
I'll be over in a bit.

809
00:36:32,650 --> 00:36:33,460
Bye-bye."

810
00:36:33,710 --> 00:36:35,920
Yun Li, can you use
a normal tone of voice?

811
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,070
I wasn't talking to you.

812
00:36:37,070 --> 00:36:37,780
If you don't like it,

813
00:36:37,780 --> 00:36:38,840
go somewhere else.

814
00:36:39,070 --> 00:36:41,130
Putting you man before your brother!

815
00:36:41,260 --> 00:36:42,860
Since you've got
my brother-in-law to shop with,

816
00:36:42,860 --> 00:36:44,260
I'm off to buy some chips.

817
00:36:44,320 --> 00:36:44,980
Bye-bye.

818
00:36:45,110 --> 00:36:46,340
Why are you in such a hurry?

819
00:36:46,340 --> 00:36:47,560
Let's go together in a bit.

820
00:36:47,560 --> 00:36:48,220
Better not.

821
00:36:48,510 --> 00:36:50,230
I need to save room before dinner.

822
00:36:50,230 --> 00:36:52,960
I don't want to fill up
on your lovey-dovey stuff.

823
00:36:53,210 --> 00:36:54,170
Don't wander off.

824
00:36:54,170 --> 00:36:55,300
We're leaving soon.

825
00:36:55,710 --> 00:36:56,710
Okay.

826
00:37:06,720 --> 00:37:07,800
Here, the meat's ready.

827
00:37:07,800 --> 00:37:09,730
I've still got some left in my bowl.

828
00:37:15,180 --> 00:37:16,710
Don't just stare at your phone.

829
00:37:16,710 --> 00:37:17,510
Eat.

830
00:37:27,650 --> 00:37:29,850
Li, you did that on purpose, didn't you?

831
00:37:30,840 --> 00:37:33,510
Well, that's what you get
for not eating properly.

832
00:37:33,510 --> 00:37:35,710
What have you been looking at all night?

833
00:37:36,510 --> 00:37:37,840
Zodiac compatibility?

834
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,170
Did you know

835
00:37:42,900 --> 00:37:44,650
Scorpio and Cancer

836
00:37:44,670 --> 00:37:46,130
are a match made in heaven?

837
00:37:46,230 --> 00:37:47,170
Since when did you

838
00:37:47,170 --> 00:37:48,300
get into astrology?

839
00:37:48,840 --> 00:37:49,460
I'm telling you,

840
00:37:49,460 --> 00:37:51,230
kids shouldn't be looking
at this stuff so much.

841
00:37:51,230 --> 00:37:52,620
You just don't get it.

842
00:37:52,880 --> 00:37:54,420
This is astronomy.

843
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:55,520
Li,

844
00:37:55,900 --> 00:37:57,500
do you know what signs we are?

845
00:37:58,380 --> 00:37:59,170
Us?

846
00:37:59,510 --> 00:38:00,610
Do I really need to check?

847
00:38:00,610 --> 00:38:01,170
I've had you under my thumb

848
00:38:01,170 --> 00:38:02,530
your whole life.

849
00:38:04,010 --> 00:38:04,570
You...

850
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,230
Um,

851
00:38:07,070 --> 00:38:08,870
what about Pisces and Aquarius?

852
00:38:08,880 --> 00:38:09,630
Pisces...

853
00:38:12,230 --> 00:38:12,780
Shize,

854
00:38:13,050 --> 00:38:15,110
y-you believe in zodiac signs too?

855
00:38:20,010 --> 00:38:21,870
I just wanna know more about them.

856
00:38:23,420 --> 00:38:24,480
Let me check.

857
00:38:25,790 --> 00:38:27,830
Pisces and Aquarius...

858
00:38:36,530 --> 00:38:38,110
T-This kind of app

859
00:38:38,110 --> 00:38:39,530
is all nonsense.

860
00:38:39,530 --> 00:38:41,320
They just make stuff up
to get people to download them.

861
00:38:41,320 --> 00:38:43,180
D-Don't bother checking, Yun Ye.

862
00:38:43,610 --> 00:38:44,670
It's just for fun.

863
00:38:47,570 --> 00:38:49,100
Your birthday's coming up.

864
00:38:49,630 --> 00:38:52,030
His birthday
falls on Lunar New Year's Eve.

865
00:38:53,770 --> 00:38:55,980
Wow, Shize, you were born
with fireworks going off!

866
00:38:55,980 --> 00:38:57,580
No wonder you're such a star.

867
00:38:57,730 --> 00:38:58,690
Well, happy birthday

868
00:38:58,690 --> 00:38:59,650
in advance.

869
00:39:00,190 --> 00:39:00,840
Thanks.

870
00:39:06,140 --> 00:39:07,630
But since it's Lunar New Year's Eve,

871
00:39:07,630 --> 00:39:09,010
my sister can only

872
00:39:09,010 --> 00:39:11,340
wish you a happy birthday in advance, too.

873
00:39:14,920 --> 00:39:15,710
It's okay.

874
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:18,380
Being with family is more important.

875
00:39:18,780 --> 00:39:20,220
Li, have you

876
00:39:20,250 --> 00:39:21,380
booked your ticket yet?

877
00:39:21,380 --> 00:39:22,420
Not yet.

878
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:24,860
Then... then let me check for you.

879
00:39:26,340 --> 00:39:28,050
Maybe I should...

880
00:39:28,080 --> 00:39:29,380
I think you should go home after all.

881
00:39:29,380 --> 00:39:31,130
It's been so long since you've been back.

882
00:39:31,130 --> 00:39:33,590
You should spend more time
with your family.

883
00:39:39,360 --> 00:39:40,010
Li,

884
00:39:40,280 --> 00:39:42,210
you need to look for tickets early.

885
00:39:42,420 --> 00:39:43,590
It's almost Chinese New Year,

886
00:39:43,590 --> 00:39:45,720
and everyone's trying to get tickets.

887
00:39:51,570 --> 00:39:52,630
This one's cooked.

888
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:55,970
They're all cooked, right?

889
00:40:10,460 --> 00:40:12,660
Who goes hiking
on Lunar New Year's Eve?

890
00:40:16,570 --> 00:40:17,900
I can't do this anymore.

891
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:19,780
I can't take another step!

892
00:40:20,940 --> 00:40:21,670
You look

893
00:40:21,670 --> 00:40:22,670
so big and strong,

894
00:40:22,670 --> 00:40:24,130
but you're so out of shape.

895
00:40:24,550 --> 00:40:26,100
What a wimp!

896
00:40:26,320 --> 00:40:27,180
Come on, ma'am.

897
00:40:28,130 --> 00:40:30,030
Skateboarding takes skill,

898
00:40:30,570 --> 00:40:32,030
not that much stamina.

899
00:40:32,130 --> 00:40:33,530
What did you just call me?

900
00:40:33,630 --> 00:40:35,030
You looking for trouble?

901
00:40:35,110 --> 00:40:36,620
I-I said miss.

902
00:40:36,980 --> 00:40:38,040
You heard me wrong.

903
00:40:38,340 --> 00:40:39,670
That's not what I meant.

904
00:40:41,770 --> 00:40:43,360
Can you even make it or not?

905
00:40:46,670 --> 00:40:47,550
Let's go!

906
00:40:52,880 --> 00:40:54,080
I can't do it anymore.

907
00:40:54,610 --> 00:40:55,610
I really can't!

908
00:40:57,440 --> 00:40:58,730
There's ice-cold cola

909
00:40:58,730 --> 00:41:00,070
and grilled sausages
waiting for you at the top.

910
00:41:00,070 --> 00:41:01,090
Keep pushing!

911
00:41:01,090 --> 00:41:02,280
Have mercy on me.

912
00:41:18,010 --> 00:41:18,510
I had no idea Nanwu

913
00:41:18,510 --> 00:41:19,970
had such a beautiful spot!

914
00:41:22,380 --> 00:41:24,310
There's a lot you haven't seen yet.

915
00:41:24,340 --> 00:41:25,600
When we get the chance,

916
00:41:25,940 --> 00:41:27,340
I'll show you all of them.

917
00:42:20,530 --> 00:42:21,150
Didn't you say

918
00:42:21,150 --> 00:42:22,190
all this stuff was fake?

919
00:42:22,190 --> 00:42:23,230
Why are you still checking?

920
00:42:23,230 --> 00:42:23,980
I'm bored.

921
00:42:23,980 --> 00:42:25,510
I-I'm just doing it for fun.

922
00:42:25,530 --> 00:42:26,340
Yun Li,

923
00:42:26,800 --> 00:42:29,200
I get the feeling
something's on your mind.

924
00:42:29,940 --> 00:42:30,730
I'm fine.

925
00:42:35,280 --> 00:42:36,000
Why are you just standing there?

926
00:42:36,000 --> 00:42:37,400
Give me a hand!

927
00:42:39,290 --> 00:42:40,340
What are you looking at?

928
00:42:40,340 --> 00:42:42,800
I'm messaging YY.

929
00:42:44,130 --> 00:42:45,080
Who's YY?

930
00:42:45,740 --> 00:42:47,260
Have you met another girl?

931
00:42:49,260 --> 00:42:50,170
No!

932
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:51,430
It's Yin Yunyi.

933
00:42:51,460 --> 00:42:52,210
YY

934
00:42:52,210 --> 00:42:53,840
are her initials.

935
00:42:56,380 --> 00:42:57,780
What are you sending her?

936
00:42:57,800 --> 00:42:58,590
Just a "1."

937
00:43:01,330 --> 00:43:04,100
I'm worried her parents
might check her phone,

938
00:43:04,210 --> 00:43:06,300
so I send her a "1"
in the morning and another at night

939
00:43:06,300 --> 00:43:08,830
as a way of saying good morning
and good night.

940
00:43:10,980 --> 00:43:12,380
You're something else.

941
00:43:12,570 --> 00:43:13,110
Then

942
00:43:13,480 --> 00:43:15,480
why does it take you so long
just to send a "1"?

943
00:43:15,480 --> 00:43:17,050
It's Chinese New Year today,

944
00:43:17,050 --> 00:43:18,420
so I sent one extra "1."

945
00:43:23,230 --> 00:43:24,000
Yun Ye,

946
00:43:24,020 --> 00:43:25,600
c-can I ask you something?

947
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:29,070
When you're with Yunyi,

948
00:43:29,670 --> 00:43:31,130
do you ever feel inferior?

949
00:43:32,400 --> 00:43:33,300
Inferior?

950
00:43:33,400 --> 00:43:35,200
She's so much prettier than you.

951
00:43:35,630 --> 00:43:36,440
Yun Li,

952
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:38,670
I am so handsome.

953
00:43:38,690 --> 00:43:41,290
How could I possibly
not be good enough for her?

954
00:43:46,090 --> 00:43:47,830
What's wrong?

955
00:43:48,190 --> 00:43:50,520
I want to celebrate his birthday with him.

956
00:43:51,090 --> 00:43:52,340
It's his first birthday
since we got together,

957
00:43:52,340 --> 00:43:53,380
after all.

958
00:43:54,600 --> 00:43:56,380
Isn't it because of Chinese New Year?

959
00:43:56,380 --> 00:43:57,590
We could've celebrated early,

960
00:43:57,590 --> 00:43:59,690
or even on his actual birthday.

961
00:44:00,380 --> 00:44:01,980
But he just assumed

962
00:44:02,130 --> 00:44:03,070
I'd come home.

963
00:44:03,070 --> 00:44:04,840
He didn't even try to get me to stay.

964
00:44:04,840 --> 00:44:06,900
I guess I was a little disappointed.

965
00:44:08,360 --> 00:44:09,690
Don't overthink it.

966
00:44:09,800 --> 00:44:10,570
Some people

967
00:44:10,570 --> 00:44:11,300
stop caring about birthdays

968
00:44:11,300 --> 00:44:12,400
once they're adults.

969
00:44:12,400 --> 00:44:14,230
After all, it means they're a year older.

970
00:44:14,230 --> 00:44:15,570
Maybe he's just like that

971
00:44:15,570 --> 00:44:17,300
and doesn't want to celebrate.

972
00:44:19,050 --> 00:44:19,880
I don't know.

973
00:44:20,670 --> 00:44:23,280
I just feel like there's
so much distance between us.

974
00:44:23,280 --> 00:44:25,610
There are so many things
he hasn't told me.

975
00:44:25,900 --> 00:44:27,820
Then ask him.

976
00:44:27,880 --> 00:44:29,050
I did.

977
00:44:30,530 --> 00:44:32,070
I just don't know what to say to him.

978
00:44:32,070 --> 00:44:33,090
I might be developing

979
00:44:33,090 --> 00:44:34,480
learned helplessness.

980
00:44:35,230 --> 00:44:36,480
No way...

981
00:44:39,030 --> 00:44:39,670
Yun Li.

982
00:44:40,650 --> 00:44:42,460
Don't act all tough at home,

983
00:44:42,730 --> 00:44:44,230
then let people walk
all over you out there.

984
00:44:44,230 --> 00:44:45,400
If you keep acting like this,

985
00:44:45,400 --> 00:44:46,980
I'm gonna have to take Dad's side.

986
00:44:46,980 --> 00:44:47,780
You hear me?

987
00:44:51,030 --> 00:44:51,800
Put these away.
